{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the six solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/0/d9035c03c7cca3bbddb6d651c43346077af9bf7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^6=-64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> are written in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/615e780fda439b2829922a704a60b31c5ed77191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are real, then the product of those solutions with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c1448651cd8a10495ac404500933c0edb2e6526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } -2\\quad \\text{(B) } 0\\quad \\text{(C) } 2i\\quad \\text{(D) } 4\\quad \\text{(E) } 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"301\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a2448fe22069224801ed75c9024809dc7ebde075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^6e^{6\\theta i}=2^6e^{(\\pi\\pm 2k\\pi) i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />. Solving in the usual way, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/7/a0736cc24657e4fbe87410091de1c4ebd44e26db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94d1a937b3fb36c8614000ebcda8d0cf5ce6cd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta\\in\\{\\pm 30^\\circ,\\pm 90^\\circ,\\pm 150^\\circ\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"193\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus there are only two solutions with positive real part, and they are conjugates, so their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a73145a82c08dab3912b63b00e1730defbed7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"19